{
  "duration": 142.3146875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.08,
      "text": "You've put in the time to learn the mechanics."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.8,
      "end": 4.22,
      "text": "You now know how to use AI,"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.7,
      "end": 6.4,
      "text": "and you understand the engine underneath,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.98,
      "end": 9.96,
      "text": "which means its strange behavior finally makes sense."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.86,
      "end": 12.74,
      "text": "You've achieved the core goal of this course."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.28,
      "end": 14.98,
      "text": "You are now smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.88,
      "end": 17.84,
      "text": "So that brings us to the question"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.84,
      "end": 20.16,
      "text": "almost everyone is arguing about right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.86,
      "end": 22.38,
      "text": "Where does all this actually land?"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.94,
      "end": 24.66,
      "text": "You've definitely heard the voices already."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.2,
      "end": 27.26,
      "text": "You probably know an AI optimist"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.26,
      "end": 30.0,
      "text": "who thinks this technology is amazing, fantastic,"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.7,
      "end": 33.08,
      "text": "and worthy of every other superlative they can string together."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.78,
      "end": 35.04,
      "text": "And you know an AI warrior"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.04,
      "end": 37.8,
      "text": "who is absolutely certain it's going to hurt society."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.84,
      "end": 39.68,
      "text": "Here's the honest part."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.62,
      "end": 41.3,
      "text": "Nobody knows."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.96,
      "end": 45.06,
      "text": "Not them, not us, not the people building AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 46.98,
      "text": "Think back to history class."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.74,
      "end": 49.92,
      "text": "Centuries ago, map makers had to figure out"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.92,
      "end": 51.78,
      "text": "what to do with vast stretches of ocean"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.78,
      "end": 53.18,
      "text": "they simply did not understand."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.94,
      "end": 56.36,
      "text": "Their solution was to fill those uncharted waters"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.36,
      "end": 59.02,
      "text": "with imagined sea monsters and strange serpents."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.7,
      "end": 62.36,
      "text": "The future of AI is exactly like"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.36,
      "end": 64.86,
      "text": "the unknown parts of the ocean on those old maps."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.68,
      "end": 68.04,
      "text": "The AI warriors look out at that blank space"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.04,
      "end": 69.5,
      "text": "and draw modern monsters."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.14,
      "end": 72.26,
      "text": "They picture a technology that destroys jobs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.88,
      "end": 74.72,
      "text": "hack systems, and takes over the world."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.48,
      "end": 79.18,
      "text": "Meanwhile, AI optimists stare at the exact same unknown waters"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.18,
      "end": 82.84,
      "text": "and see only easy clear sailing through open channels."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.44,
      "end": 86.18,
      "text": "But look at what those early sailors actually found"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.18,
      "end": 87.44,
      "text": "when they pushed past the edge."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.94,
      "end": 88.94,
      "text": "They didn't run into sea monsters"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.44,
      "end": 91.68,
      "text": "and they very rarely got easy clear sailing."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.44,
      "end": 93.48,
      "text": "What they usually encountered"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.48,
      "end": 95.24,
      "text": "was something completely unexpected."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.36,
      "end": 97.28,
      "text": "Throughout this section,"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.48,
      "end": 99.86,
      "text": "we are going to take both views of our map seriously,"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.5,
      "end": 102.1,
      "text": "the very real risks of the monsters"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.1,
      "end": 104.52,
      "text": "and the genuine benefits of the open water."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.2,
      "end": 107.04,
      "text": "As we do, only one thing is certain."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.52,
      "end": 108.8,
      "text": "AI is here to stay."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.6,
      "end": 111.3,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it keeps getting better forever"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.78,
      "end": 113.86,
      "text": "just that the technology isn't going away."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.4,
      "end": 115.86,
      "text": "This section will help you answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.86,
      "end": 117.1,
      "text": "three specific questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.16,
      "end": 121.3,
      "text": "One, why do people disagree so much about AI's future?"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.24,
      "end": 124.72,
      "text": "Two, what could AI do to make society better"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.06,
      "end": 126.38,
      "text": "and where could it go wrong?"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.16,
      "end": 131.04,
      "text": "And three, how could AI change my future life and work?"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.86,
      "end": 133.34,
      "text": "Nobody has a map of what's coming."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.94,
      "end": 135.82,
      "text": "You're ready to sail into the blank space."
    }
  ],
